Version 2.2.2 (2025/08/10)
* Added an option to limit the display of character-specific (i.e., non-account-
  wide) achievements; this requires LibMultiAccountAchievements 1.1.1 or newer

Version 2.2.1 (2024/09/20)
* Workaround for an issue where the game would sometimes signal that an
  achievement was updated even though nothing was actually changed

Version 2.2.0 (2024/09/18)
* Partial credit displayed under the Unearned section will now include a
  clickable link to the achievement, which will allow the user to see more
  details of another account's progress with the achievement

Version 2.1.1 (2024/09/12)
* Coalesced chat messages for achievements whose progress are updated multiple
  times within half a second

Version 2.1.0 (2024/09/11)
* Added a feature to show updates to achievement progress in chat
  - This feature is disabled by default and can be enabled in the settings panel

Version 2.0.1 (2024/07/12)
* The Unearned section will now display partial credit under appropriate
  circumstances

Version 2.0.0 (2024/07/09)
* Renamed to Extended Achievement Credit and added support for the new
  LibMultiAccountAchievements library

Version 1.1.1 (2022/04/13)
* The historical credit list is now aligned with the achievement's title and
  description text, rather than the achievement's icon

Version 1.1.0 (2022/04/12)
* The current character will now be highlighted if it appears in the historical
  credit list for an achievement
* If the current character had earned partial progress on an achievement prior
  to Update 33, that partial progress will now be shown as well

Version 1.0.2 (2022/04/05)
* Added a count of the number characters

Version 1.0.1 (2022/04/05)
* Added an option to hide the times from the dates column

Version 1.0.0 (2022/04/05)
* Initial version
